<title>USA: Unimed begins Phase III trial on testosterone gel.</title>
<headline>Unimed begins Phase III trial on testosterone gel.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unimed Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it began the Phase III human clinical trial with Androgel, a new development for treating testosterone deficiency in men.</p>
<p>The new product facilitates the once-daily administration of testosterone in a topical gel formulation.</p>
